<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Вступление:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Dm</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Hm</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>/5-/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>f</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Снился
мне путь на
север<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Снежная
гладь да тишь<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
будто б
открылось
небо<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">  </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
будто бы ты
глядишь<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7 <span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
