<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
ангелы все в
сиянье<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И с
ними в одном
строю<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Рядом
с тобой одна<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Та,
которую я
люблю<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Я
говорю:
“Послушай<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Что
б ты хотел,
ответь<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Тело
моё и душу<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Жизнь
мою и смерть<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Всё
что ещё не
спето<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Место
в твоём раю<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Только
оставь мне ту<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="GramE"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Которую</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> я
люблю”<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Проигрыш:
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F <span class="SpellE">F</span> C <span class="SpellE">C</span>
Gm/e <span class="SpellE">Gm/e</span> A <span class="SpellE">A</span>, Dm <span class="SpellE">Dm</span> F <span class="SpellE">F</span> E <span class="SpellE">E</span>
E/d E/c E/h Am<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>В
сердце
немного
света<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Лампочка
в тридцать
ватт<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Перегорит
и это<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>С <span class="GramE">новой</span>
спускаться в
ад<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>А
мы всё летим
не глядя<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>На
ледяном краю<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
держит меня
одна<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Та,
которую я
люблю<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Проигрыш:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
